# Public build configuration. Never put API tokens or private research data here.
# Default for Vercel / a custom domain / GitHub user or organization Pages:
VITE_BASE_PATH=/

# Set to the real public deployment root before producing an indexable build.
# Include the repository path for GitHub project Pages. No trailing slash needed.
# Leave empty for local previews: the build will disable indexing and write an empty sitemap.
SITE_URL=
